     9	/// Anti-F5-4 (class-sweep, claim 9): no raw GetX placeholder may survive
    10	/// substitution on driver offer/stop screens.
    11	///
    12	/// Forge AUDIT B-1 disposition (client 2026-10-22,ses_e9d0f219): the probe is
    13	/// token-scoped and ENUMERATIVE, not a fixture list:
    14	///  1. tokens are derived from `lib/core/utils/my_strings.dart` AT RUNTIME;
    15	///  2. every token must be substitutable by BOTH channels (rKv curly/at
    16	///     forms AND GetX trParams);
    17	///  3. the raw-token sweep walks `lib/` with only two allowlisted files
    18	///     (`my_strings.dart` itself, `string_format_helper.dart` doc-hint).
    19	void main() {
    20	  group('rKv helper substitutes both placeholder forms', () {
    21	    test('curly_{key}_form', () {
